{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-24726","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-29392","text":"03 — Invocation Gateway"}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-24728","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-29393","marks":["bold"],"text":"Purpose:"},{"id":"spn-29394","text":" How agent invocations flow through the Edge Function gateway, including the canonical request/response shapes, authentication, limit checks, session handling, streaming, and error normalization."}]}],"id":"blk-24727","kind":"quote"},{"id":"blk-24729","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-29395","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-24730","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-29396","text":"Gateway Overview"}]},{"id":"blk-24731","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-29397","text":"The invocation gateway is a Supabase Edge Function at "},{"id":"spn-29398","marks":["code"],"text":"/functions/v1/invoke/:agentId"},{"id":"spn-29399","text":". It authenticates the caller, checks plan limits, resolves the active deployment, routes to the runtime provider adapter, and returns a normalized response."}]},{"id":"blk-24732","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-29400","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-24733","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-29401","text":"Request Shape ("},{"id":"spn-29402","marks":["code"],"text":"InvokeRequest"},{"id":"spn-29403","text":")"}]},{"id":"blk-24734","kind":"code","language":"typescript","text":"interface InvokeRequest {\n  input: {\n    messages?: Array<{\n      role: \"system\" | \"user\" | \"assistant\" | \"tool\";\n      content: string;\n    }>;\n    prompt?: string;  // converted to messages if provided\n  };\n  sessionId?: string;  // opaque; provider-specific\n  options?: {\n    maxSteps?: number;\n    temperature?: number;\n    toolPolicy?: { allow?: string[]; deny?: string[] };\n  };\n  metadata?: {\n    traceId?: string;\n    client?: string;\n  };\n}"},{"id":"blk-24735","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-29404","marks":["bold"],"text":"Rule:"},{"id":"spn-29405","text":" If "},{"id":"spn-29406","marks":["code"],"text":"prompt"},{"id":"spn-29407","text":" is provided instead of "},{"id":"spn-29408","marks":["code"],"text":"messages"},{"id":"spn-29409","text":", the gateway converts it to "},{"id":"spn-29410","marks":["code"],"text":"[{ role: \"user\", content: prompt }]"},{"id":"spn-29411","text":" before forwarding."}]},{"id":"blk-24736","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-29412","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-24737","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-29413","text":"Response Shape ("},{"id":"spn-29414","marks":["code"],"text":"InvokeResponse"},{"id":"spn-29415","text":")"}]},{"id":"blk-24738","kind":"code","language":"typescript","text":"interface InvokeResponse {\n  output: {\n    text: string;\n    messages?: Array<{ role: string; content: string }>;\n  };\n  sessionId?: string;\n  usage: {\n    tokens?: number;\n    computeMs?: number;\n    toolCalls?: number;\n  };\n  traceId: string;\n  error?: NormalizedError;\n}"},{"id":"blk-24739","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-29416","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-24740","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-29417","text":"Gateway Pipeline"}]},{"id":"blk-24741","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"1. Parse request\n2. Authenticate (Supabase Auth JWT)\n3. Load agent record (RLS-filtered)\n4. Verify agent.status === \"active\"\n5. Resolve active deployment + runtime provider\n6. Check plan limits (billing_usage vs tier limits)\n7. Generate traceId (if not provided)\n8. Route to RPI adapter: invoke(input, sessionId, options)\n9. Normalize response\n10. Return to caller"},{"id":"blk-24742","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-29418","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-24743","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-29419","text":"Authentication"}]},{"id":"blk-24744","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-29420","text":"All invocations require a valid Supabase Auth JWT in the "},{"id":"spn-29421","marks":["code"],"text":"Authorization"},{"id":"spn-29422","text":" header:"}]},{"id":"blk-24745","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"Authorization: Bearer <supabase-jwt>"},{"id":"blk-24746","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-29423","text":"The gateway extracts "},{"id":"spn-29424","marks":["code"],"text":"auth.uid()"},{"id":"spn-29425","text":" and uses it to load the agent via RLS. If the agent does not belong to the caller, the query returns empty and the gateway returns "},{"id":"spn-29426","marks":["code"],"text":"NOT_FOUND"},{"id":"spn-29427","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-24747","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-29428","text":"Post-MVP: per-agent API keys for public invocation."}]},{"id":"blk-24748","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-29429","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-24749","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-29430","text":"Limit Checks"}]},{"id":"blk-24750","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-29431","text":"Before routing to the provider, the gateway checks:"}]},{"id":"blk-24751","kind":"code","language":"sql","text":"SELECT total_requests, total_tokens, total_compute_ms\nFROM billing_usage\nWHERE user_id = auth.uid()\n  AND period_key = current_period();"},{"id":"blk-24752","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-29432","text":"If any metric exceeds the user's tier limit, the gateway returns "},{"id":"spn-29433","marks":["code"],"text":"LIMIT_EXCEEDED"},{"id":"spn-29434","text":" without invoking the agent."}]},{"id":"blk-24753","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-29435","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-24754","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-29436","text":"Session Handling"}]},{"id":"blk-24755","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-24757","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-29437","text":"If "},{"id":"spn-29438","marks":["code"],"text":"sessionId"},{"id":"spn-29439","text":" is provided, it is forwarded to the provider as-is."}]}],"id":"blk-24756","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-24759","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-29440","text":"If absent, the provider may create a new session and return the "},{"id":"spn-29441","marks":["code"],"text":"sessionId"},{"id":"spn-29442","text":"."}]}],"id":"blk-24758","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-24761","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-29443","text":"The gateway treats "},{"id":"spn-29444","marks":["code"],"text":"sessionId"},{"id":"spn-29445","text":" as "},{"id":"spn-29446","marks":["bold"],"text":"opaque"},{"id":"spn-29447","text":" -- never parses or validates it."}]}],"id":"blk-24760","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-24763","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-29448","text":"Session semantics are provider-specific (DO instance for Cloudflare, runtime"}]}],"id":"blk-24762","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-24764","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-29449","text":"session for AgentCore)."}]},{"id":"blk-24765","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-29450","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-24766","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-29451","text":"Streaming"}]},{"id":"blk-24767","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-29452","text":"When the provider supports streaming, the gateway uses Server-Sent Events (SSE):"}]},{"id":"blk-24768","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"Content-Type: text/event-stream\n\ndata: {\"type\":\"chunk\",\"text\":\"Hello\"}\ndata: {\"type\":\"chunk\",\"text\":\" world\"}\ndata: {\"type\":\"done\",\"usage\":{\"tokens\":12,\"computeMs\":340}}"},{"id":"blk-24769","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-29453","text":"When a provider does not support true streaming, the gateway MAY emulate it by returning the full response as a single chunk followed by "},{"id":"spn-29454","marks":["code"],"text":"done"},{"id":"spn-29455","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-24770","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-29456","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-24771","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-29457","text":"Error Normalization"}]},{"id":"blk-24772","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-29458","text":"All errors are mapped to a standard code set:"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-24774","spans":[{"id":"spn-29459","text":"Code"}]},{"id":"blk-24775","spans":[{"id":"spn-29460","text":"HTTP Status"}]},{"id":"blk-24776","spans":[{"id":"spn-29461","text":"Meaning"}]}],"id":"blk-24773","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-24777","spans":[{"id":"spn-29462","marks":["code"],"text":"UNAUTHENTICATED"}]},{"id":"blk-24778","spans":[{"id":"spn-29463","text":"401"}]},{"id":"blk-24779","spans":[{"id":"spn-29464","text":"Missing or invalid JWT"}]}],[{"id":"blk-24780","spans":[{"id":"spn-29465","marks":["code"],"text":"UNAUTHORIZED"}]},{"id":"blk-24781","spans":[{"id":"spn-29466","text":"403"}]},{"id":"blk-24782","spans":[{"id":"spn-29467","text":"Valid JWT but no access to this agent"}]}],[{"id":"blk-24783","spans":[{"id":"spn-29468","marks":["code"],"text":"NOT_FOUND"}]},{"id":"blk-24784","spans":[{"id":"spn-29469","text":"404"}]},{"id":"blk-24785","spans":[{"id":"spn-29470","text":"Agent does not exist (or not owned by caller)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-24786","spans":[{"id":"spn-29471","marks":["code"],"text":"LIMIT_EXCEEDED"}]},{"id":"blk-24787","spans":[{"id":"spn-29472","text":"429"}]},{"id":"blk-24788","spans":[{"id":"spn-29473","text":"Plan limit reached for this period"}]}],[{"id":"blk-24789","spans":[{"id":"spn-29474","marks":["code"],"text":"DEPLOYMENT_FAILED"}]},{"id":"blk-24790","spans":[{"id":"spn-29475","text":"502"}]},{"id":"blk-24791","spans":[{"id":"spn-29476","text":"No active deployment or deployment is broken"}]}],[{"id":"blk-24792","spans":[{"id":"spn-29477","marks":["code"],"text":"RUNTIME_ERROR"}]},{"id":"blk-24793","spans":[{"id":"spn-29478","text":"502"}]},{"id":"blk-24794","spans":[{"id":"spn-29479","text":"Provider returned an error during execution"}]}],[{"id":"blk-24795","spans":[{"id":"spn-29480","marks":["code"],"text":"INVALID_REQUEST"}]},{"id":"blk-24796","spans":[{"id":"spn-29481","text":"400"}]},{"id":"blk-24797","spans":[{"id":"spn-29482","text":"Malformed input or missing required fields"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-24798","kind":"code","language":"json","text":"{\n  \"error\": {\n    \"code\": \"LIMIT_EXCEEDED\",\n    \"message\": \"Monthly request limit reached. Upgrade your plan.\",\n    \"traceId\": \"tr_abc123\"\n  }\n}"},{"id":"blk-24799","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-29483","marks":["bold"],"text":"Rule:"},{"id":"spn-29484","text":" Error messages must be safe for display. Never include secrets or internal stack traces."}]},{"id":"blk-24800","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-29485","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-24801","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-29486","text":"Rate Limiting"}]},{"id":"blk-24802","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-29487","text":"The gateway SHOULD enforce per-user and per-agent rate limits beyond plan quotas:"}]},{"id":"blk-24803","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-24805","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-29488","text":"Per-user: max N requests/second across all agents"}]}],"id":"blk-24804","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-24807","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-29489","text":"Per-agent: max M requests/second per agent"}]}],"id":"blk-24806","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-24809","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-29490","text":"Payload size: max 1 MB request body"}]}],"id":"blk-24808","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-24810","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-29491","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-24811","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-29492","text":"Checklist"}]},{"id":"blk-24812","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-24814","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-29493","text":"[ ] Every invocation is authenticated via Supabase Auth JWT"}]}],"id":"blk-24813","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-24816","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-29494","text":"[ ] Agent status is verified as "},{"id":"spn-29495","marks":["code"],"text":"active"},{"id":"spn-29496","text":" before routing"}]}],"id":"blk-24815","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-24818","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-29497","text":"[ ] Plan limits are checked before invoking the provider"}]}],"id":"blk-24817","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-24820","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-29498","text":"[ ] "},{"id":"spn-29499","marks":["code"],"text":"traceId"},{"id":"spn-29500","text":" is generated or forwarded on every request"}]}],"id":"blk-24819","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-24822","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-29501","text":"[ ] Errors are normalized to the standard code set"}]}],"id":"blk-24821","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-24824","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-29502","text":"[ ] Error messages never contain secrets or internal details"}]}],"id":"blk-24823","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-24826","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-29503","text":"[ ] "},{"id":"spn-29504","marks":["code"],"text":"sessionId"},{"id":"spn-29505","text":" is treated as opaque"}]}],"id":"blk-24825","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-24828","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-29506","text":"[ ] Streaming uses SSE format when supported"}]}],"id":"blk-24827","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-24830","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-29507","text":"[ ] Request payload size is validated"}]}],"id":"blk-24829","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaierawbqmqh5ccay4en5tpgq4oliapynoyq7fcsmfpo2jqpax47j7lr5a","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}